menu "LG SoC drivers"

config LG1314_VDEC
	tristate "LG1314 video-decode coprocessor"
	depends on ARCH_LG1K || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	help
	  Bring-up driver for the Xtensa video-decode coprocessor on the
	  LG1314 TV SoC: loads the decode firmware into a reserved DRAM
	  carveout and releases the coprocessor from reset.

	  Say Y here to enable hardware video decode on LG1314-based TVs.

endmenu
